# Netlify Redirects Configuration
# 1. Canonical Domain Redirect
https://everyday-gut-wellness.netlify.app/*  https://everydaygutwellness.com/:splat  301!

# 2. API routes redirected to Netlify Functions
/api/health            /.netlify/functions/health          200
/api/admin/verify      /.netlify/functions/admin-verify    200!
/api/leads/export.csv  /.netlify/functions/leads-export    200
/api/leads             /.netlify/functions/leads           200
/api/subscribe         /.netlify/functions/subscribe       200!
/api/gumroad-webhook   /.netlify/functions/gumroad-webhook 200!

# 2. Unknown API routes return JSON 404 (does not swallow API errors)
/api/*                 /.netlify/functions/api-not-found   404

# 3. No catch-all SPA fallback: the app uses #hash navigation, so unknown
#    paths fall through to Netlify's real 404 (public/404.html, status 404).

